{"number":719,"title":"build: update Wrangler and generated types","body":"## Summary

- update Wrangler from 4.156.0 to 4.156.1 in the frontend and Worker;
- regenerate both npm lockfiles with npm 12.2.1;
- version the two official `wrangler types` outputs and exclude generated declarations from handwritten-code linters;
- update the current changelogs and the mirrored third-party notices.

Contributes to LCV-533

## Validation

- Worker: TypeScript check, ESLint, Biome, 69 tests in 11 files, Wrangler dry-run.
- Frontend: TypeScript check, ESLint, Biome, 69 tests in 17 files, production build.
- `npm audit`: zero known vulnerabilities in both package trees.
- Worker registry signatures: 190 packages verified, including 84 attestations.

